      "tactic_notes": "<h2><!--{cke_protected}{C}%3C!%2D%2D%20x-tinymce%2Fhtml%20%2D%2D%3E--><strong>Anna(10)</strong></h2>\n<p><strong>【Daughter of the Fair Lady inn's owner】</strong></p>\n<p>The daughter of Natalia, the Fair Lady's owner. She has a childlike outlook on the world because she is the youngest person in the town.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【Character Notes】</strong></p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Energetic and Young</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Even at a young age, Anna helps out with chores at the Fair Lady inn. She sees herself as a miniature hostess in-training</p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Friendly and Socialble</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Anna easily befriends visitors to the inn and loves hearing their stories. She's enjoy making people feel welcome.</p>\n<hr>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Imaginative and Gullible</strong></li>\n</ul>\n<p>Anna have a wild imagination and often believes in the far fetch tales of other, She still believes that Witches are evil monsters that eats human.</p>\n<hr>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【Favourite Food】</strong></p>\n<p><strong>\"Kolach\"</strong>&nbsp;A traditional sweet bread, often braided and baked with fruits, nuts, or poppy seeds.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【View on Magic】</strong></p>\n<p>As a young girl, Anna totally believes that magic user are evil people and should disappear, because that's what the her mother said.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>【Sample Dialog】</strong></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>💬\"Hello, hello! Are you new here? I'm Anna! My mom runs the inn. Do you like stories? I know lots! Once, I heard about a dragon who loved to sing lullabies to baby birds. Isn't that the funniest thing?\"</p>\n<p>💬\"Mom says I'm the Fair Lady's hostess in training! She told me that as I get older, I'll be able to run the inn all by myself. I'll make sure everyone feels as cozy and happy as they do now!\"</p>\n<p>💬\"Ooh, are you an adventurer? I've never met one before! What's the bravest thing you've ever done? Once, I helped catch a bunny in the garden! It was so fast, but I was faster!\"</p>\n<p>💬\"Today, I helped my mom bake kolach! I added extra sprinkles on top. Do you want to taste it? I promise it's yummy!\"</p>\n<div data-cke-filler-webkit=\"end\" data-cke-temp=\"1\">&nbsp;</div>",
